 "statement": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": "s1 and s2 are strings of words separated by single spaces (an empty string has no words). Let A and B be the sets of distinct words. Return |A intersect B| / |A union B| rounded to two decimal places with halves rounded up, as a floating-point number (the nearest double to the rounded decimal), and 1.0 when both strings are empty.",
